        "value": "<p data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"144\"><strong data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"142\">Genes Analyzed:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"360\">\n<li data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"182\">\n<p data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"182\"><strong data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"161\">CSF3R Gene</strong> &ndash; <em data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"180\">Exon 14 and 17</em></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"360\">\n<p data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"360\"><strong data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"200\">SETBP1 Gene</strong> &ndash; <em data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"211\">Exon 4</em><br data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"214\"><strong data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"225\">Method:</strong> Next-Generation Sequencing (NGS) / Sanger Sequencing (lab dependent)<br data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"297\"><strong data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"313\">Sample Type:</strong> Peripheral Blood / Bone Marrow Aspirate (EDTA)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>RESULTS:</strong></p>\n<table style=\"height: 154px; width: 91.2997%;\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"height: 33px;\">\n<th style=\"width: 14.7632%;\"><strong>Gene</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width: 10.7959%;\"><strong>Exon</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width: 30.2145%;\"><strong>Mutation</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width: 37.4782%;\"><strong>Status</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 14.7632%;\"><strong>CSF3R</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 10.7959%;\">14</td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.2145%;\">e.g., T618I</td>\n<td style=\"width: 37.4782%;\"><em>Detected / Not Detected</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 14.7632%;\"><strong>CSF3R</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 10.7959%;\">17</td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.2145%;\">e.g., Other variants</td>\n<td style=\"width: 37.4782%;\"><em>Detected / Not Detected</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 42px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 14.7632%;\"><strong>SETBP1</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 10.7959%;\">4</td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.2145%;\">e.g., D868N</td>\n<td style=\"width: 37.4782%;\"><em>Detected / Not Detected</em></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
